    "type": "question",
    "label": "23",
    "prompt": "Let $x\\in\\mathbb R$ and define $\\lfloor x\\rfloor$ and $\\lceil x\\rceil$ by\n$$\\begin{aligned}\\lfloor x\\rfloor&=\\max\\{m\\in\\mathbb Z\\text{ where }m\\le x\\}\\\\\\lceil x\\rceil&=\\min\\{m\\in\\mathbb Z\\text{ where }m\\ge x\\}\\end{aligned}$$\nThese are respectively called the $\\mathit{floor}$ and $\\mathit{ceiling}$ of $x$. Find the value of",
    "layout": "grid",
    "columns": 2,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p47-q75-response",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "$\\lfloor2.999\\rfloor$.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$2$",
          "worked": "$2\\le2.999<3$, so the greatest integer no greater than $2.999$ is $2$. Hence $\\lfloor2.999\\rfloor=2$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 24
      },
      {
        "id": "p47-q76-response",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$\\lceil\\pi\\rceil$.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$4$",
          "worked": "$3<\\pi<4$, so the least integer no smaller than $\\pi$ is $4$. Hence $\\lceil\\pi\\rceil=4$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 18
      },
      {
        "id": "p47-q77-response",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "$\\lfloor\\sqrt2\\rfloor$.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$1$",
          "worked": "$1<\\sqrt2<2$, so the greatest integer no greater than $\\sqrt2$ is $1$. Hence $\\lfloor\\sqrt2\\rfloor=1$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 18
      },
      {
        "id": "p47-q78-response",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "d",
